      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Heritage Center preserves photographs, memorabilia, and publications that document the diverse homesteaders who settled southeastern Colorado’s grasslands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
